---
layout: page.njk
title: Writing
kicker: Archive
description: Sermons, scholarship, teaching, ministry, and personal reflection.
permalink: /blog/
---
<div class="archive-list h-feed">
<p><span class="p-name">Writing</span> by <a class="p-author h-card p-name u-url" rel="author" href="{{ metadata.author.url }}">{{ metadata.author.name }}</a></p>
{% for post in collections.posts | reverse %}
  <article class="h-entry">
    <p><time class="dt-published" datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>{% if post.data.tags %} · {% for tag in post.data.tags %}<span class="p-category">{{ tag }}</span>{% if not loop.last %} · {% endif %}{% endfor %}{% endif %}</p>
    <h2><a class="p-name u-url" href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title | safe }}</a></h2>
    {% if post.data.description %}<p class="p-summary">{{ post.data.description }}</p>{% endif %}
  </article>
{% endfor %}
</div>
